e components for assembling a <strong>desktop train model</strong>. To complete the assembly for an entirely functional piece, users also need to download the model files and 3D print the remaining parts.</div>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"></div>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"></div>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><em><span style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\">Creator Program</span><span style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\">:</span></em></strong></span><strong><em> </em></strong>The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs.</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<tbody><!-- 第一行 --><!-- 第二行 -->\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\"><strong>Model</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\"><strong>Creator</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\"><b>Model Link</b></td>\n</tr>\n<!-- 第三行 -->\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\">\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-page-id=\"OKsfdVZTpoQRnExo2lIcyoskncC\">\n<div class=\"old-record-id-WN9wdvxjroLLKUxZrwrcWzjZnhd\">Endless Loop Express</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"lark-record-clipboard\" data-lark-record-data='{\"rootId\":\"OKsfdVZTpoQRnExo2lIcyoskncC\",\"text\":{\"initialAttributedTexts\":{\"text\":{\"0\":\"Button\"},\"attribs\":{\"0\":\"*0+6\"}},\"apool\":{\"numToAttrib\":{\"0\":[\"author\",\"7118919285765865474\"]},\"nextNum\":1}},\"type\":\"text\",\"referenceRecordMap\":{},\"extra\":{\"mention_page_title\":{},\"external_mention_url\":{}},\"isKeepQuoteContainer\":false,\"isFromCode\":false,\"selection\":[{\"id\":64,\"type\":\"text\",\"selection\":{\"start\":0,\"end\":6},\"recordId\":\"WN9wdvxjroLLKUxZrwrcWzjZnhd\"}],\"payloadMap\":{},\"isCut\":false}' data-lark-record-format=\"docx/text\"></span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">IMD_Q.</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\"><strong><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><a href=\"https://makerworld.com/en/models/431820?from=search#profileId-348512\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #00ae42;\" target=\"_blank\">Endless Loop Express</a></span></strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"></div>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\" style=\"text-align: start;\">\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-page-id=\"OKsfdVZTpoQRnExo2lIcyoskncC\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K4OCdHYOOop5aGxqeiFcWXYnnXe\"></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K4OCdHYOOop5aGxqeiFcWXYnnXe\">To download the model files of <strong>Endless Loop Express </strong>and obtain detailed information, please visit the <strong>Endless Loop Express</strong> on <a href=\"https://makerworld.com/en/models/431820?from=search#profileId-348512\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><strong><u>MakerWorld</u></strong></span></a>.</div>\n<br/><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/8e81e4ee58ee4f1fb405a9d126b851d1/1a0131d637ff5b88f0146384e77220c1_498aebf3-2382-4cf3-9a66-0b4acf37dbc2.jpg\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K4OCdHYOOop5aGxqeiFcWXYnnXe\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></span></div>\n<!-- 图片部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_ic\" style=\"flex: 3;\"><!-- 手机端图片 -->\n<p><video autoplay=\"autoplay\" class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--video bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" controls=\"controls\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-mce-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/949c07de0ecb4af6b317e0249eef26f5/629e62c200fd43d79f70020b9708f2cd.mp4\" data-mce-style=\"width: 100%;\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/949c07de0ecb4af6b317e0249eef26f5/629e62c200fd43d79f70020b9708f2cd.mp4\" height=\"150\" loop=\"loop\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/a2f839f1ee6c4638b06fa8b8d2b9f97e/11_e85cbe6a-e44b-44f6-a85d-0b28d852d362.png\" style=\"width: 100%;\" width=\"300\"></video></p>\n</div>\n<br/>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Installation</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">Please refer to the <span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><strong><a href=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/ed9318ec4e97459b93575a822155b94d/Endless_Loop_Express_Kit-K016.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #00ae42;\" target=\"_blank\">installation manual</a></strong></span> for the assembly of <strong>Endless Loop Express</strong>.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"></div>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"></div>\n<!-- 第四条 -->\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">In the Box</h3>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<tbody><!-- 第一行 --><!-- 第二行 -->\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\"><strong>Item</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\"><strong>Qty</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<!-- 第三行 -->\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\">\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-page-id=\"OKsfdVZTpoQRnExo2lIcyoskncC\">\n<div class=\"old-record-id-WN9wdvxjroLLKUxZrwrcWzjZnhd\">N20 Dual Shaft Worm Gear Motor 130rpm</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"lark-record-clipboard\" data-lark-record-data='{\"rootId\":\"OKsfdVZTpoQRnExo2lIcyoskncC\",\"text\":{\"initialAttributedTexts\":{\"text\":{\"0\":\"Button\"},\"attribs\":{\"0\":\"*0+6\"}},\"apool\":{\"numToAttrib\":{\"0\":[\"author\",\"7118919285765865474\"]},\"nextNum\":1}},\"type\":\"text\",\"referenceRecordMap\":{},\"extra\":{\"mention_page_title\":{},\"external_mention_url\":{}},\"isKeepQuoteContainer\":false,\"isFromCode\":false,\"selection\":[{\"id\":64,\"type\":\"text\",\"selection\":{\"start\":0,\"end\":6},\"recordId\":\"WN9wdvxjroLLKUxZrwrcWzjZnhd\"}],\"payloadMap\":{},\"isCut\":false}' data-lark-record-format=\"docx/text\"></span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">1 PCS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\">AAA Battery Spring Contact Plate with PH2.0 Connector</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\"><span>1 PCS</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\">Self-Locking Button Switch</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\"><span>1 PCS</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\">M2x6 FHCS (Machine Screw)</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\"><span>19 PCS</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\">D4x2 mm Round Magnet</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\"><span>2 PCS</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\">100mm Y type PH2.0 to Dual SH1.0 Conversion Wire</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\"><span>1 PCS</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<span><span></span></span></div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"></div>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"> </div>\n<!-- 第五条 -->\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">Notes</h3>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">1.<span data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> </span><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Please note that the Endless Loop Express <strong>does not come with batteries</strong>. Please bring your own AAA battery to power the Endless Loop Express.</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- table布局 -->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Product Specifications</h2>\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<tbody><!-- 第一行 --><!-- 第二行 -->\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\"><b>Packaging Size</b></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\">70*100*35 mm</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\"><strong>Product Weight</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\"><span>36.9 g</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><button id=\"paste-helper-id\" style=\"width: 0px; height: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; border: 0px; display: none;\"></button><button id=\"paste-helper-id\" style=\"width: 0px; height: 0px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; border: 0px; display: none;\"></button></p>\n</div>",
  "description_text": "Creator Program: The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs.\n\nTo download the model files of Endless Loop Express and obtain detailed information, please visit the Endless Loop Express on MakerWorld.\n\nPlease refer to the installation manual for the assembly of Endless Loop Express.\n\n1. Please note that the Endless Loop Express does not come with batteries. Please bring your own AAA battery to power the Endless Loop Express.",
